    {
      "stem": "cantor_hineni",
      "urn": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hineni_the_prayer_of_the_shaliach_tsibur",
      "title": {
        "he": "הנני העני ממעש",
        "en": "Hineni"
      },
      "languages": {
        "he": [
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s198",
                "printed_page": "89",
                "text": "הִנְנִי הֶעָנִי מִמַּעַשׂ וְנִרְעָשׁ וְנִפְחָד מִפַּחַד יוֹשֵׁב תְּהִלּוֹת יִשְׂרָאֵל בָּאתִי לַעֲמוֹד וּלְחַנֵּן לְפָנֶיךָ עַל עַמְּךָ יִשְׂרָאֵל אֲשֶׁר שְׁלָחוּנִי וְאַף עַל פִּי שֶׁאֵינִי כְדַי וְהָגוּן לְכָךְ:",
                "page_start": false
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hineni_the_prayer_of_the_shaliach_tsibur/1"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s198",
                "printed_page": "89",
                "text": " עַל כֵּן אֲבַקֶּשְׁךָ אֱלֹהֵי אַבְרָהָם אֱלֹהֵי יִצְחָק וֵאלֹהֵי יַעֲקֹב. יְיָ יְיָ אֵל רַחוּם וְחַנּוּן, אֱלֹהִים. שַׁדַּי אָיוֹם וְנוֹרָא. הֱיֵה נָא מַצְלִיחַ דַּרְכִּי אֲשֶׁר אָנֹכִי הוֹלֵךְ לַעֲמוֹד לְבַקֵּשׁ רַחֲמִים עָלַי וְעַל שׁוֹלְחָי.",
                "page_start": false
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hineni_the_prayer_of_the_shaliach_tsibur/2"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s198",
                "printed_page": "89",
                "text": " וְנָא אַל תַּפְשִׁיעֵם בְּחַטֹּאתַי וְאַל תְּחַיְּבֵם בַּעֲוֹנוֹתַי כִּי חוֹטֵא וּפוֹשֵׁעַ אָנִי וְאַל יִכָּלְמוּ בִּי בִּפְשָׁעַי וְאַל יֵבוֹשׁוּ בִי וְאַל אֵבוֹשָׁה בָהֶם וְקַבֵּל תְּפִלָּתִי כִּתְפִלַּת זָקֵן וְרָגִיל וּפִרְקוֹ נָאֶה וּזְקָנוֹ מְגֻדָּל וְקוֹלוֹ נָעִים וּמְעֹרָב בְּדַעַת עִם הַבְּרִיּוֹת. וְתִגְעַר בְּשָׂטָן לְבַל יַשְׂטִינֵנוּ.",
                "page_start": false
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hineni_the_prayer_of_the_shaliach_tsibur/3"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s198",
                "printed_page": "89",
                "text": " וִיהִי נָא דִגְלֵנוּ עָלֶיךָ אַהֲבָה. לְכָל פְּשָׁעִים תְּכַסֶּה בְאַהֲבָה. וְכָל צוֹמוֹתֵינוּ וְעִנּוּיֵינוּ הֲפֹךְ לָנוּ וּלְכָל יִשְׂרָאֵל לְשָׂשׂוֹן וּלְשִׂמְחָה לְחַיִּים וּלְשָׁלוֹם. הָאֱמֶת וְהַשָּׁלוֹם אֱהָבוּ וְאַל יְהִי שׁוּם מִכְשׁוֹל בִּתְפִלָּתִי:",
                "page_start": false
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hineni_the_prayer_of_the_shaliach_tsibur/4"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 2,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s198",
                "printed_page": "89",
                "text": "וִיהִי רָצוֹן לְפָנֶיךָ יְיָ אֱלֹהֵי אַבְרָהָם אֱלֹהֵי יִצְחָק וֵאלֹהֵי יַעֲקֹב הָאֵל הַגָּדוֹל הַגִּבּוֹר וְהַנּוֹרָא אֵל עֶלְיוֹן אֶהְיֶה אֲשֶׁר אֶהְיֶה שֶׁכָּל הַמַּלְאָכִים שֶׁהֵם בַּעֲלֵי תְפִלּוֹת יָבִיאוּ תְפִלָּתִי לִפְנֵי כִסֵּא כְבוֹדֶךָ וְיָפִיצוּ אוֹתָהּ לְפָנֶיךָ בַּעֲבוּר כָּל הַצַּדִּיקִים וְהַחֲסִידִים הַתְּמִימִים וְהַיְשָׁרִים וּבַעֲבוּר כְּבוֹד שִׁמְךָ הַגָּדוֹל הַגִּבּוֹר וְהַנּוֹרָא כִּי אַתָּה שׁוֹמֵעַ תְּפִלַּת עַמְּךָ יִשְׂרָאֵל בְּרַחֲמִים בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה שׁוֹמֵעַ תְּפִלָּה:",
                "page_start": false
              }
            ],
            "end_reference": true,
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hineni_the_prayer_of_the_shaliach_tsibur/5"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s199",
                "printed_page": "89",
                "text": "Behold I come, poor in deeds, shaking and trembling with fear, before Him, who is enthroned above Israel’s songs of praise, to appear and entreat before Thee for Thy people Israel, who have sent me, although I am neither deserving nor worthy of this.",
                "page_start": false
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hineni_the_prayer_of_the_shaliach_tsibur/1"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s199",
                "printed_page": "89",
                "text": " Therefore I implore Thee, God of Abraham, God of Isaac and God of Jacob, O Lord, Lord, merciful and gracious God, O God, Almighty, fearful and awe-inspiring, let my way meet with success, for I am about to approach to beg mercy for myself and those who send me.",
                "page_start": false
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hineni_the_prayer_of_the_shaliach_tsibur/2"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s199",
                "printed_page": "89",
                "text": " Hold them not guilty for my sins, do not condemn them because of my guilt, for I am a sinner and transgressor; may they not be put to shame because of my transgressions; let them not be disgraced through me nor I through them. Accept my prayer as if it were the prayer of an elder, who is experienced, whose conduct is seemly, whose beard is imposing, whose voice is pleasant and who enjoys the love of his fellow men. Rebuke Satan that he may not oppose us.",
                "page_start": false
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hineni_the_prayer_of_the_shaliach_tsibur/3"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s199",
                "printed_page": "89",
                "text": " Let our banner before Thee be love, cover all transgressions with love, transform our fasts and our afflictions for us and all Israel into joy and mirth, for life and peace. Love truth and peace; and let there be no hindrance in my prayer.",
                "page_start": false
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hineni_the_prayer_of_the_shaliach_tsibur/4"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 2,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s199",
                "printed_page": "89",
                "text": "May it be Thy will, O Lord, God of Abraham, God of Isaac and God of Jacob, great, strong and awe-inspiring God, supreme God, whose name is: “I am that I am”, that all the angels who are bearers of prayers, may bring my prayer before Thy glorious throne and spread it before Thee, for the sake of all the righteous, the pious, the perfect and the upright and for the sake of Thy great, strong and awe-inspiring Name; for Thou hearest the prayer of Thy people Israel in compassion. Blessed art Thou, hearer of prayer.",
                "page_start": false
              }
            ],
            "end_reference": true,
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hineni_the_prayer_of_the_shaliach_tsibur/5"
          }
        ]
      },
      "instructions": [
        {
          "text": "תפלה אחרת לש״ץ.",
          "language": "he",
          "witnesses": [
